# Men at their ease: tired, grumbling, teasing, gossiping.

== tam_resting
where: garrison
when: at_ease, asleep(Tam)
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: once
A [looks:the shed]: Is Tam asleep again?
B: He's resting his eyes.
A: For three hours?
B [shrugs]: They're very tired eyes.

== wat_sings
where: garrison
when: at_ease, present(Wat), present(Aldous)
cast: A = name(Aldous); B = name(Wat)
cooldown: 15m
B [murmurs]: Oh, the eel-wife of the Low Bridge, she had a crooked leg...
A [shouts]: Wat! Sing that again and I'll shoot you myself.
B: You haven't got a bow, old man.
A: I'll find one.

== the_moon_glass
where: garrison
when: at_ease, night:early|middle
cast: A = recruit; B = friend(A)|any
cooldown: once
A [looks:the tower]: What does the captain want with a glass that looks at the moon?
B: Same thing Hollin wants with his emeralds. To have it.
A: Brand says it shows you where the dead walk.
B {if stubborn}: Brand says a lot of things. None of them sober.
B: Brand says a lot of things. Eat your supper.

== hendriks_girl
where: garrison
when: at_ease
cast: A = name(Hendrik); B = friend(A)
cooldown: once
B: You're quiet tonight.
A: My girl's fever's back.
B: The physick in the Lower Town...
A [sighs]: Wants silver I haven't got. She'll mend. They mend.
B [nods]: She'll mend.

== oil_gone
where: garrison
when: at_ease
cast: A = name(Gideon); B = name(Wat)
cooldown: 20m
A: Two flasks of lamp oil, gone. Again.
B: Rats.
A: Rats that climb shelves and pull corks?
B [shrugs]: Clever rats.

== mothers_letter
where: garrison
when: at_ease, night:early|middle
cast: A = name(Osric); B = kin(A)
cooldown: once
A: Mother wrote. She asks if you're eating.
B: Tell her I'm eating.
A: She asks about the girl at the Lantern.
B [laughs]: Tell her I'm eating.

# The small talk of any two men on any night.

== quiet_tonight
when: at_ease
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 2m
group: small_talk
A: Quiet tonight.
B: Too quiet. I don't like it.

== freeze_the_piss
when: at_ease
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 2m
group: small_talk
A: Cold enough to freeze the piss in you.
B: Then stop standing in the wind.

== relief_due
when: at_ease
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 2m
group: small_talk
A: When's the relief due?
B: Not soon enough.

== foul_mood
where: garrison
when: at_ease
cast: A = not(captain); B = not(captain)
cooldown: 2m
group: small_talk
A: The captain's in a foul mood again.
B: When isn't she?

== kill_for_a_drink
when: at_ease
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 2m
group: small_talk
A: I'd kill for a drink.
B: Wait till the watch changes.

== owe_for_dice
when: at_ease
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 2m
group: small_talk
A: You still owe me for the dice.
B: Put it on my tab.

== keep_haunted
when: at_ease
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 2m
group: small_talk
A: They say the old keep's haunted.
B: They say a lot of things.

== your_stomach
when: at_ease
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 2m
group: small_talk
A: Did you hear something?
B: Only your stomach.

# The men of the yard, and what is between them.

== brand_rats
where: garrison
when: at_ease
cast: A = name(Brand); B = name(Ned)
cooldown: once
A: Oi, recruit. Ever seen a rat the size of a dog?
B: No...
A: Keep your feet off the drains, then.
B {if craven}: You're making that up. Aren't you?
B: I'll keep that in mind.

== col_supper
where: garrison
when: at_ease
cast: A = name(Col); B = friend(A)
cooldown: once
A: You going to eat that?
B: I was.
A: Were.
B [sighs]: Take it.

== aldous_snow
when: at_ease
cast: A = old_guard; B = any
cooldown: once
A: My knees say snow before morning.
B: Your knees said that last week.
A: And was it warm last week?
B [shrugs]: No.

== wat_fishwife
when: at_ease
cast: A = gambler; B = any
cooldown: once
A: The fishmonger's wife ran off with a bargeman.
B: Which fishmonger?
A: Does it matter? It's a good story either way.

== hendrik_wall
where: garrison
when: at_ease
cast: A = name(Hendrik); B = name(Ned)
cooldown: once
A: Keep your back to a wall, Ned. Always.
B: Why?
A: So nothing comes at you from where you can't see.
B [nods]: A wall. Right.

== gideon_candles
when: at_ease
cast: A = ledger; B = any
cooldown: once
A: Eleven candles signed out. Nine came back.
B: Maybe they burned.
A: Candles don't burn in a cupboard.

== jory_south
when: at_ease
cast: A = sweetheart; B = any
cooldown: once
A: When the pay comes, I'm taking her south.
B: South's a long way on a guard's pay.
A [shrugs]: Then we'll walk slow.

== captain_from
where: garrison
when: at_ease, present(Mirelle)
cast: A = not(captain); B = not(captain)
cooldown: once
A: Where's the captain from, anyway?
B: The south. Where the sun comes out.
A: No wonder she's always cold.

== glass_worth
when: at_ease
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 15m
A: What's it worth, that glass in the tower?
B: More than you'll earn if you live to a hundred.
A: Then why's it guarded by us?
B [laughs]: We come cheap.

== lantern_round
when: at_ease
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 15m
A: First round at the Lantern when we're off?
B: If you're paying.
A: I paid last time.
B: Then you know how it's done.

== canal_smell
where: garrison
when: at_ease, present(Brand)
cast: A = not(name(Brand)); B = not(name(Brand))
cooldown: 15m
A: Smell that? The canal's up again.
B: That's not the canal. That's Brand's boots.

== hollin_emeralds
where: garrison
when: at_ease
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: once
A: Hollin had his emeralds stolen, they say.
B: Out of a locked room, three floors up.
A: Good thing we've no emeralds here.
B [looks:the tower]: No. Just the glass.

== tam_saw
where: garrison
when: at_ease, asleep(Tam)
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: once
A [looks:the shed]: Listen to him. Like a saw through wet wood.
B: At least we know he's alive.

== col_luck
when: at_ease
cast: A = any; B = lucky
cooldown: once
A: How do you win every throw?
B [shrugs]: Clean living.
A: You've never lived clean a day in your life.

== wat_aldous_tower
where: garrison
when: at_ease, present(Aldous)
cast: A = name(Wat); B = name(Aldous)
cooldown: 15m
A [shouts]: Still up your tower, old man?
B [shouts]: Still down on your arse, boy?

== osric_brother
where: garrison
when: at_ease, present(Jory)
cast: A = name(Osric); B = not(kin(A))
cooldown: once
A: Keep an eye on my brother tonight.
B: He's a grown man.
A: He's a grown man with his head in the clouds.
